      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if therapy even works for this. it feels deeper than just being tired. it's like there's no point in trying to fix it because the \"me\" that's supposed to be fixing it isn't even there. i'm just a shell. even talking about it feels exhausting and pointless. like i'm just rearranging the grayness around.",
