    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. it just feels like there's no way to actually break the glass. i spend all day pretending to be a person, and then i come home and it's just that same heavy silence. i'm just so tired of waiting for something to change that clearly won't. does it ever actually get better, or do people just get used to living like ghosts?",
